nd crew atmosphere, but note concerns.\n\nPublic message: share our private observations about A, B, C, D, highlight reliability of C, crew atmosphere, and note concerns about A's criticism, B's grumpiness, D's arrogance. Suggest we need more info on C's communication and willingness to develop.\n\nLet's produce."}
